WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.830
Walkways, forklift routes, and emergency exits must stay clear.

2
00:00:04.830 --> 00:00:10.070
Never leave cartons, pallets, cables, or equipment where people travel.

3
00:00:10.070 --> 00:00:12.597
Keep fire doors and exit signs visible.

4
00:00:12.597 --> 00:00:17.070
If you find an obstruction, protect the area and arrange removal using

5
00:00:17.070 --> 00:00:18.188
your site process.

6
00:00:18.188 --> 00:00:21.698
Do not step around it and assume the next person will notice.

7
00:00:21.698 --> 00:00:25.700
Pause and think: Which route must stay clear during your next task?
